    <projectnotes width="400" x="700" y="10" maximized="0" height="300" visible="0" minimized="0"><![CDATA[Desolatum - chaos warning rumble (sound effect, 10 s). Low rumble swelling over distant footfalls that speed up. Export without looping: the tail should ring out. Loop markers cover the whole song; export with "Export between loop markers" for a seamless game loop.]]></projectnotes>
